				<description>A 1 in bit m selects event m to set output n (or clear it if SETCLRn = 0x1 or 0x2) event 0 = bit 0, event 1 = bit 1,..., event 15 = bit 15.</description>												
				<bitRange>[6:6]</bitRange>												
