				<bitRange>[10:10]</bitRange>												
			</field>													
			<field>													
				<name>CLR11</name>												
				<description>A 1 in bit m selects event m to clear output n (or set it if SETCLRn = 0x1 or 0x2) event 0 = bit 0, event 1 = bit 1,..., event 15 = bit 15.</description>												
